WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.986
I'm Rerun.

00:00:02.656 --> 00:00:06.313
My shell is glass,
and the receipts are inside it.

00:00:07.463 --> 00:00:08.800
That is the point.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.912
A claim should carry its own evidence,
so anyone can run the check again.

00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:18.115
I knock on a claim to hear
whether anything is in there.

00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:21.476
Sometimes my guess is wrong.

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:24.877
I keep count of those,
right here on my claw.
